 # TellPlot 架构概览
 
-## 核心数据流
-
-TellPlot 把原始财务事实、可编辑叙事状态、确定性操作、图表家族投影和 G2 渲染分开管理。
-
-```text
-ChartConfig -> public adapter -> SourceData + ViewSpec -> Command Executor
-                                       |              -> CommandLog / undo / redo
-                                       +-> Chart Projection -> G2Spec -> G2 Runtime
-                                       +-> persistence / host commands
+TellPlot 采用 core、imperative editor 和 framework adapter 分层。编辑能力只实现一次。
+
+```mermaid
+flowchart LR
+  Host["Host application"] --> React["@tellplot/react"]
+  Host --> Vue["@tellplot/vue"]
+  Host --> Editor["@tellplot/editor createEditor"]
+  React --> Editor
+  Vue --> Editor
+  Editor --> Core["@tellplot/core EditorStore"]
+  Core --> Commands["Commands and history"]
+  Core --> Projection["Chart projections"]
+  Editor --> G2["G2 screen and export runtime"]
